        "action": "UK Government to call on Pakistan to end killings in Pakistan-Azad Kashmir",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We urge the UK Government to act immediately to call on the Pakistan Government to help stop the killing of innocent civilians in Pakistan-administered Kashmir. The UK Government must condemn these killings, call for an end to the violence and protect civilians, using the threat of sanctions.",
